VALUES('KRCHN','Paper I','Medical-Surgical Nursing','Professional Practice','What does the term "therapeutic communication" refer to in nursing practice?','Using medical jargon to communicate with patients','Promoting open and honest communication with patients for therapeutic purposes','Providing written instructions to patients','Documenting patient information in the medical record','B','Therapeutic communication involves creating a supportive and empathetic environment through verbal and non-verbal techniques to promote patient well-being and facilitate the nurse-patient relationship (Brunner & Suddarth; nursing communication texts).','easy',NULL,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

