VALUES('KRCHN','Paper I','Medical-Surgical Nursing','Professional Practice','What is the primary goal of the nursing process in patient care?','Administering medications','Monitoring vital signs','Providing emotional support','Promoting patient well-being through systematic assessment, planning, intervention and evaluation','D','The nursing process (ADPIE) is a systematic, evidence-based approach to patient care that promotes patient well-being through assessment, diagnosis, planning, implementation and evaluation (nursing process texts; Brunner & Suddarth).','easy',NULL,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

