VALUES('KRCHN','Paper I','Medical-Surgical Nursing','Respiratory Disorders','What is the primary goal of administering oxygen therapy in nursing practice?','To decrease oxygen levels in the bloodstream','To increase the risk of respiratory distress','To provide supplemental oxygen to patients with respiratory problems','To minimise communication with the patient','C','Oxygen therapy is administered to correct hypoxaemia and improve tissue oxygenation in patients with respiratory problems (Brunner & Suddarth; respiratory nursing; MOH Kenya oxygen guidelines).','easy',NULL,'approved',NULL)ON CONFLICT(stem,cadre)DO NOTHING;

